# A lost keyboard releases the Meta layer; no tap reaches the virtual keyboard.
# KEY_INSERT (110) is released before KEY_LEFTMETA (125): key code order.
0 in key KEY_SPACE down
400 in key KEY_INSERT down
400 out key KEY_LEFTMETA down
400 out key KEY_INSERT down
500 in lost
500 out key KEY_INSERT up
500 out key KEY_LEFTMETA up
